squall (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Squall release — rebranded fork of Deluge.
  * Switch build system to dh-virtualenv.
  * Add SSL peers support.
  * Use PHC string format for stored password hashes.
  * Bump minimum Python to 3.10.

